16. Offline-First Operation

The following must work without internet:

- Launching the app.
- Opening saved projects.
- Editing robot assemblies.
- Running supported simulations.
- Executing supported visual programs.
- Accessing bundled tutorials.
- Saving project changes.
- Viewing previous experiment results.

Internet access may be used for optional updates or user-initiated imports, but no core workflow should require an online AI service.

No user account is required for the MVP.

